### Eliminar jobs visibles (con JB017) — resultado esperado (200, affectedJobs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [51021]
}

### Un job no visible → 400 "No tiene acceso a uno o más jobs" (no se elimina ninguno)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAgent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [51021]
}

### Sin jobs → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": []
}
